# psi/test_espc.py Window test_win_pmacs_live's sequence (the pin
# M10_PINS['pmacs_edit'], docs/simpos/subsystems/pmacs.md §6): Login PIMOS
# from the system menu; the HELD disc/exshow.esp started by the M10
# harness (`start exshow`, OURS); a left click in its window selects it;
# C-x C-f me:usercom.init RETURN (find_file), `Hi` (insert), Ctrl-2 (the
# mark, control#"@": tools/simpos_live.py, OURS), C-e, C-w (the first
# line's own text killed into the yank buffer), C-n, C-e, C-y (yanked),
# C-x C-w me:new.esp RETURN (write_file), C-x 2 (two views).
click r 640 560
click r 640 560
click l 978 605
quiet
start exshow
click l 200 150
ctrlkey x
ctrlkey f
type me:usercom.init
key enter
type Hi
ctrlkey 2
ctrlkey e
ctrlkey w
ctrlkey n
ctrlkey e
ctrlkey y
ctrlkey x
ctrlkey w
type me:new.esp
key enter
ctrlkey x
type 2
quiet
